$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Example 3 - Preparation of C60 Isocyanate. C60
malonyl azide prepared according to Example 2 (87 mg, 0.1 mmol) was
heated at 80°C in dry toluene (100 mL) for 3 hours. Toluene was removed.
C60 Isocyanate, black residue. Yield was almost quantitative. 1H-NMR
(CDCl3), 300 MHz, ppm): 4.68 (q, J = 7.1 Hz, 2H, CH2), 1.63 (t, J = 7.1
Hz, 3H, CH3 on the ethyl). MALDI-MS (m/z): 847 (M+H+). FT-IR (cm-1):
2240.2, 1731.4 (Figure 2).
