$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of the azide (2: 0.365 g, 0.317 mmol) in toluene
(18 mL) was added alcohol (0.090 g, 0.476 mmol) and the mixture was
stirred at 80 °C for 16 hours. The reaction was concentrated and the
crude mixture was purified by flash chromatography (EtOAc). 0.387 g
(0.295 mmol, 93%) of the boc-protected amine.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Curtius rearrangement
