toluene (60 mL) was added the alcohol (0.354 g, 3.00 mmol) and the
mixture was stirred at 80 °C for 4 h. The reaction was concentrated in
vacuo and the crude product was purified by flash chromatography
(heptane/EtOAc). 1.01 g (0.815 mmol, 81.5%) of the intermediate ester.
