$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A solution of the unpurified dihydroisocoumarin acid (32 mg, 0.041 mmol)
in acetone (2.0 mL) was cooled to 0°C and i-Pr2NEt (17 μL, 2.4 equiv.)
was added followed by addition of isobutyl chloroformate (12 μL, 2.2
equiv.) After 45 min at 0°C. NaN3 (14 mg, 5.0 equiv.) was dissolved in
H2O (0.3 mL) and added to the reaction over 2 min. After 20 min, cold H2O
(2 mL) was added and the reaction extracted with cold EtOAc (3x3 mL). The
combined organic layers were dried thoroughly over MgSO4 and
concentrated. The residue was azeotroped with benzene (3x2 mL) and then
placed on the vacuum pump for 30 min. The unpurified acyl azide was
dissolved in toluene (2.0 mL), the reaction flask fitted with a reflux
condenser, and then heated to 80°C. After 45 min, 2-trimethylsilylethanol
(0.118 mL, 20 equiv.) was added through the top of the reflux condenser.
After 2 h, the reaction was cooled to rt and the solvent evaporated.
Flash chromatography (10% EtOAc/hexanes to 20% EtOAc/hexanes) provided
(+)-2.49 (27 mg, 74% yield) as a colorless oil. (+)-2.49 (27 mg, 74%
yield) [α]D20 +29.7 (c 1.0, CHCl3); IR (neat) 3325, 2953, 2896, 2858,
1717, 1592, 1459, 1248, 1155, 1072 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.63-7.27 (m, 1 OH), 6.47 (s, 1H), 5.38 (d, J= 10.1 Hz, 1H), 5.17 (dd, J=
33.6, 12.5 Hz, 2H), 5.03 (s, 2H), 4.90 (dd, J= 10.0, 2.5 Hz, 1H), 4.33
(ddd, J = 11.7, 6.9, 2.3 Hz, 1H), 4.26-4.10 (m, 3H), 3.98 (d, J = 9.3 Hz,
1H), 3.67 (s, 1H), 3.63 (d, J= 10.7 Hz, 1H), 3.57 (dd, J= 4.9, 3.2 Hz,
1H), 3.37 (s, 3H), 3.12 (dd, J= 16.4, 2.1 Hz, 1H), 2.83 (dd,J= 16.4, 11.9
Hz, 1H), 2.43-2.31 (m, 1H), 2.15 (s, 3H), 1.94-1.78 (m, 2H), 1.45(d,J=
15.0 Hz, 1H), 1.13 (d, J= 6.9 Hz, 3H), 1.02-0.92 (m, 2H) 1.01 (s, 3H),
0.90 (s, 9H), 0.89 (s, 3H), 0.05 (s, 3H), 0.04 (s, 3H), 0.02 (s, 9H); 13C
NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 163.6, 161.1, 160.3, 157.2, 142.2, 137.1, 136.6,
128.9, 128.7, 128.5, 128.3, 127.9, 127.3, 127.1, 116.3, 108.2, 98.2,
83.7, 83.6, 79.2, 73.0, 72.8, 71.4, 70.4, 68.0, 63.7, 55.8, 43.5, 38.1,
32.8, 31.1, 29.8, 26.1, 26.0, 18.2, 17.8, 11.4, 10.2, -1.3, -4.3, -4.8;
high resolution mass spectrum (ES+) m/z 914.4707 [(M+Na)+; calcd for
C49H73NO10Si2Na: 914.4671].
