$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Methyl 2-[3-(2-Methoxyphenyl)ureido]pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyridine-
3-carboxylate (10) Compound 10 was prepared using o-anisidine and was
obtained as a light pink solid after flash chromatography (PE-EtOAc,
3:7); yield: 1.12 g (73%). Mp 222-224 °C. Rf = 0.63 (PE-EtOAc, 2:8). IR
(ATR diamond): 3425, 3344, 2949, 2162, 1825, 1671, 1601, 1533, 1377,
1344, 1207, 1110, 1025, 783, 751, 631 cm-1. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ =
10.67 (s, 1 H, NH), 8.64 (s, 1 H, NH), 8.39 (dd, J = 7.7, 1.8 Hz, 1 H),
8.34 (d, J = 6.8 Hz, 1 H), 7.96 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 1 H), 7.43 (t, J = 8.7
Hz, 1 H), 7.11-6.78 (m, 4 H), 4.00 (s, 3 H, OCH3), 3.96 (s, 3 H, OCH3).
13C NMR (101 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 164.1 (CO), 152.7 (CO), 151.1 (Cq), 148.5
(Cq), 140.8 (Cq), 128.6 (CH), 128.6 (CH), 128.5 (Cq), 123.0 (CH), 121.2
(CH), 119.9 (CH), 118.1 (CH), 113.5 (CH), 110.2 (CH), 88.6 (Cq), 56.1
(CH3), 51.4 (CH3). HRMS (ESI): m/z [M + H]+ calcd for C17H16N4O4:
341.1244; found: 341.1245.
